OL,3,ASlipknot fans hit back after Marilyn
OL,4,AManson announced as support act for UK
OL,5,Ashow
OL,6,
OL,7,FHeavy metal band Slipknot have
OL,8,Fannounced a new world tour, with
OL,9,FMarilyn Manson due to appear as a
OL,10,Fsupport act.
OL,12,FThe eight-piece group, known for
OL,13,Fperforming in masks, will be joined by
OL,14,Fthe US rock musician during their shows
OL,15,Fat London's Wembley Stadium and
OL,16,Fmultiple dates of the South American
OL,17,Fleg of the tour.
OL,19,FSome fans have reacted angrily to the
OL,20,Fnews and said they will not attend the
OL,21,Fshows over past sexual abuse
OL,22,Faccusations against the 57-year-old.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
