OL,3,ATaylor Swift breaks record for most MTV
OL,4,AVMAs as Madonna also wins
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaylor Swift took home the video of the
OL,7,Fyear award as she became the most
OL,8,Fsuccessful artist in the history of the
OL,9,FMTV Video Music Awards on Sunday.
OL,11,FThe singer went into the night tied
OL,12,Fwith Beyonce on 30 wins, and went on to
OL,13,Fscore the night's top award for the
OL,14,Fvisuals for her track The Fate of
OL,15,FOphelia, taken from her 2025 album The
OL,16,FLife of a Showgirl.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
